  "implementation_findings": [
    "Actual layer requires real VerifiedProtobufBindings and matching runtime identity; no fake-class fallback. Parent synthetic response values are serialized by actual generated classes.",
    "Original serve, supervisor, ActionCoordinator, SQLite journal and ScopedTransport perform the chain. ACTION is independently read back before factory/connect/send.",
    "Three query frames are recovered from the test-only prebound byte registry and compared against original ACTIONs; journal and registry byte-read-only recovery is asserted.",
    "Command, interpreter, one-time argv/list2cmdline, cwd and sanitized environment are bound to the original TestWorkerSpec. Child can connect only to its own held loopback listener.",
    "Actual peer bytes, retained responses and VERIFIED_RESPONSE rows link to the original ACTION request and response hashes. No snapshot, claim, economic observation or order was created."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Borrowed r7 private runtime plus hash-bound current source is controlled test assembly, not a feature already packaged in r7 or production bootstrap acceptance.",
